{"server":"tw","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_st03","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_st03","title":"過客","storyCode":"AT-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"17d84104d151ed7ad46be74d00993c62e7225ebe2098f9b5904be3e7969cbbfd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"星熊回到龍門，萌萌香在御機繼續自己的事業。而那位森內此前一直追逐的神明，出現在引發了整場事件，卻也是和事件最沒有關係的人面前。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的就寫了這麼一句話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有必要騙你嗎？她的信還在我這裡呢。要看嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（清清喉嚨）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口*，我聽說你爺爺被你氣走了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有落款，全信完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣你也笑得出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，我不知道她字寫快了竟然有點像狂草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，不是在她親自把這封信拍在你臉上之後，事情就解釋清楚了嗎，“詩懷雅局長”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠！要不是星熊那傢伙這麽彆扭，我才不會找你出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來就不需要你找我。我們見面的次數越少越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宣布，你碗裡最後一顆鱗丸歸我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請便，就當是錯怪你的賠罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真輕描淡寫啊，臭老鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還想怎樣？在新汐斯塔和你爺爺唱反調，至少這件事不能算我錯怪你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你說……我是不是也該找星熊聊聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該，但是最近不適合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我知道她最近要嘛躲我，要嘛就一本正經地叫我官職，但其實我能看出來，我們兩個的關係並沒有變得比較疏遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟發生了這麼多事，她得避嫌，她錯怪了我不好意思，還有，畢竟她那邊也算是長輩去世……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有那麼敏感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？我覺得她偶爾也有點多愁善感……也不能這麼說，嗯，我想想，怎麼描述她那種狀態呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等陳暉潔回來，說不定可以幫你一起想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的意思是說，她現在那副樣子，可能根本就不是因為她想了那麼多，只是單純想拿你找樂子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭！老！鼠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊我知根知底，她才不像你，一百個心眼，老奸巨猾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承蒙誇獎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmenbridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝星熊督察幫我帶的伴手禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太客氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊督察去東國的這段時間以來，不知為何，我竟然沒少光顧那家姜齊煎餅店，吃到後來，竟然也覺得蔥段很美味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，據說星熊督察在御機也遭逢不少變故，還能想著幫我帶東西，這份心意實在是彌足珍貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我在御機也惹了不少麻煩，萬幸沒鬧到驚動夫人與魏先生，也沒讓龍門難辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這回事。我聽說都是你智勇雙全，不僅洗刷了自己的冤屈，還幫情同義父的鐵齋先生報仇的佳話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個金兵衛本來也不是什麼善類，被捕受審是理所當然。星熊督察心存善念，沒有下重手，這才是便宜了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……夫人，我還有一件事想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必拘泥，直接問吧。上次我在街上開快了一點，你攔我的時候也沒這麼扭扭捏捏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從御機回來之後，其實一直在想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門和御機……究竟有什麼不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我已經可以心安理得地說自己是龍門人，但御機對我而言，卻無論如何也沒辦法再當成一個家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為林先生對黑道管理有方？因為龍門沒有所謂神明？不，原因不該是這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，一座城市裡最重要的，只有人，一個一個生活在城市裡的，活生生的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是人就會做夢，而一座城裡的人在做什麼樣的夢，這座城市就會傳頌什麼樣的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人是說……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御機在做的夢，龍門早已醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好你仍然在那邊交了一些好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是我這次回御機最大的收穫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有收穫，那不就很好嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好我也有件奇聞想跟督察分享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是和御機鄰近的姬戶城，最近出現了一名少年英俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位俠客把容顏包得十分嚴密。明明刀法不怎麼樣，打人卻只用一把木刀，還總能用不要命的招數克敵制勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但偏偏就是這麼一位看起來不太能成事的少俠，解決了姬戶城盤踞多年的詐騙集團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據他自己說，他是從御機一路走到姬戶的。他在姬戶也不打算待很久，休整幾天，就要去下一個城市逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝他一路順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一件事，雖然沒有那麼稀奇，不過也算和星熊督察有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御機有位被撤職的警察，最近打算競選議員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能選上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九成九選不上。但成不了的事，就不去做了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，天也聊得差不多，煎餅也吃得差不多，是時候開始下一輪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人今天是換了新車沒錯，不過我的“老戰友”未必會輸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到，還沒發動引擎，氣勢上就先被星熊督察壓了一頭啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這套衣服的功勞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頂多占三分之一吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竹輪、白蘿蔔、馱獸筋。給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演藝事務所準備得怎麼樣了？還順利嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有好有壞。不管怎麼說，還算是穩定進步中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊走的時候你哭成那個樣子，我還怕你也跟著離開御機去龍門呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不至於，不至於。星熊走有她走的原因，我留下也有我留下的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？才過多久而已，羽生萌萌香小姐已經有談判專家的氣質了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要亂講。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——好燙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃慢一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……是很燙沒錯，但也很香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，森內老闆，我可能確實會離開御機一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊說的那個羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我知道，自己現在已經和萌萌香這個名字緊緊扣在一起，難以分割了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的確也在想，也許，在一個沒人認識羽生萌萌香的地方，紫野遙也能短暫地擁有她自己的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少星熊認識你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別打岔，我很認真耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我知道啦。說不定我也可以去看看，也許能再多交幾個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森內老闆，你說……這樣的日子還能持續多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然這麼問？我不太懂你想說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很難說清楚，但我總覺得，這樣的日子，可能不會太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你越說我越不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是……怎麼說呢，仁田街每晚擠滿了人，鍛冶町的高樓馬上就要蓋好了，我走在街上發現十個人裡有九個人都在聊房價大漲的日子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的每場演出都能一夜售空，和粉絲握手握到手都脫了一層皮的日子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總覺得，這樣的日子，也許不會太長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在亂想什麼啊，戰爭？北院打過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許也不用他們這麼做。或許……他們也會被我們捲進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有電話打來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是吉星……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，大新聞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？房市暴跌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蛤？你還沒睡醒嗎？今天那個什麼新成屋不是又創新高了嗎？哪裡暴跌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是說更紗啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更紗？她不是在哲也走後不久也離開御機了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她寄了一封信給我，信紙上還印著家紋，錦織家的家紋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錦織家……北院四大家族的那個錦織家？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她說前一陣子在御機玩得很開心，但是鬧得有點大，怕被家裡發現，所以回鎖川避避風頭，等一切平息之後再來找我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這還不算是大新聞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這個確實是大新聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信裡面還寫了你的事，說她得知你在搞演藝事務所，如果真的成功了，她說不定也加盟一下玩一玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的事務所？偶像？錦織家的大小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，噓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您沒有別的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你辦事很穩，比三船可靠多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"金石會現在歸你管，但金石集團還是個燙手山芋，沒什麼人想接。有沒有興趣收拾他那些七零八落的遺產，帶著金石會再重出江湖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了，議員大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是，收拾他的遺產看似容易，實際做起來，又不知道會有多少艱難險阻在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想這樣過一輩子？當一個連巢穴都沒了的黑幫的大姐頭，直到終老？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只不過是給在社會上無法立足的人硬湊一個家，做些善後工作罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再者，假如御機已經不需要金石會，我也不可能永遠這麼硬撐下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金石會也好，金石集團也好，我都已經待夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我來，不光是替三船先生完成他對您的承諾，也是來告知您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經盡最大努力為金石會善後，現在特地來向您辭行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你心意已決，我就不強求了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，明明很漂亮，可惜長了顆比烏薩斯的冰原還冷的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是一片好意，她卻無論如何也不領情，這樣的人還真罕見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管那麼多了。先看看貨。"},{"type":"narration","text":"大腹便便的議員從裝潢奢華的會客室站起身，往深處的一扇小門走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"令人跌破眼鏡的是，那扇小門裡沒有機密文件，也沒有金銀珠寶。\n那裡甚至沒有多餘的娛樂設施，就和一個普通的邋遢東國人居住的單人房沒什麼區別……\n除了房間中央放著的那台老舊的小鋼珠機台。\n這台在鍛冶町逃過一劫的機器此刻已經接上了專用的電路，亮了起來，發出失真的音樂聲。\n剛剛還頗有些威嚴的議員大人已經迫不及待地坐到機器前面，打算玩上一把。\n他從腳邊抓起一籃堆得像小山一樣高的小鋼珠，打算放進機器裡，機器背後忽然傳來說話聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神明的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如願以償？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的是的，多謝神明大人保佑，我終於如願以償了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也多謝神明大人時隔多日，終於又願意出現在我家裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您之前在我家待了那麼多年，前兩天忽然不見蹤影，差點嚇死我了！我還以為您棄我於不顧了呢！真是久違了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"神明輕巧地跳上小鋼珠機台的頂端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞了這麼大陣仗，就為了這台機器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是啊！說起來，我因為這台機器翻身，還不是託您的福嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾輩不記得自己幫你託過什麼福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕後面發生的所有事情您都沒有相助，只憑二十年前的那件往事，也足以讓我記得一輩子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是那件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是那件事啊，讓我從一個廢人，從一個社會敗類，變成一個堂堂正正的人的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早都說過了，那件事跟吾輩沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，您又說這種話。想想看，那時我是什麼樣的人？整天在家閒閒沒事，也不工作，也不讀書……用現在流行的話，叫——對，啃老族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每天早上找老媽要錢，去店裡打一把小鋼珠。贏了我就覺得當天的運氣不錯，輸了，那就是一天都要倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但就在那天，那個改變我命運的日子——我在街上看到了您的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那天我從早上贏到晚上，小鋼珠像流水一樣從機器裡吐出來、吐出來、吐出來，整個店裡的托盤都不夠裝我這台機器贏的鋼珠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後我贏了一大筆，足以去仁田街推車做小買賣的“一大筆”。畢竟只是小鋼珠，我贏的總不可能比那家店還值錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但您的出現，告訴了我一件事……我不再是廢人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從那一天起，我堅信，自己是被您，被您贈予我的運氣……被神明眷顧的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有您贈予我的運氣，我又怎麼可能用小鋼珠贏來的錢，一步步投機、翻本、鑽漏洞，直到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾輩贈予你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然是您贈予我的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就說這幾天吧，您不是不在嗎？我的事情就辦得不順利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我讓金兵衛那小子把這台鋼珠機給我搞回來。本來是很簡單的一件事，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我不可能直接跟他說，於是我說，拿下鍛冶町，設計個開發案，順便去把這台鋼珠機搞過來，那個東西和我有點因緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後一切就亂套了。鍛冶町的黑道、龍門的警察，還有金兵衛自己手底下的藝人……亂成了一團，機器也差點沒保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*東國粗口*，要是這台被您眷顧的機器出了什麼閃失，把那塊河邊的爛地建成御機的商業中心，又有什麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且不只是我，整個御機……整個南院都受您的眷顧，所以我們才發展得這麼快，我們的地產才每天漲個不停，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"北院的那些臭鄉下人眉毛都要氣歪了，但您不願過去，他們一點辦法都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有您的眷顧，我們一定會越來越好，越來越好，直到……"},{"type":"narration","text":"議員臉上流下一滴汗珠。不是因為緊張，而是因為眉飛色舞地講了半天，他已經開始覺得熱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到……永遠！"},{"type":"narration","text":"而他眼前的神明，站在鋼珠機的頂端俯視著他……\n俯視著這間議員秘密買下，連通向這裡的電梯都是VIP專屬的三十層高級大樓……\n俯視著將近幾百公尺的樓下，喧囂而嘈雜的御機……\n而後淡淡地吐出一句祂已經說到厭煩了，卻鮮少有人當真的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久違的神明 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和吾輩有什麼關係。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"神明輕巧地跳走，離開狹小的房間，而早已按捺不住、想儘快打一把小鋼珠的議員並未注意到這一點。\n那天之後，他再也沒有見過神明的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g7_jinja_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們談多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少三個小時了，感覺完全沒有想結束的意思。我可以去上個廁所嗎？馬上就回來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還想跑是嗎？在御機闖了這麼大的禍，八大家的家主你一個人引來兩個，還差點引發南北糾紛，你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家老爺子也就算了，您畢竟也是一方宮司，葉家那頭老鹿再怎麼說也不能拿你怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕不是八大家族，論血脈您也絕對不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口無遮攔！哪怕你自己不想活了，也不要連累你那些朋友們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然還寄信給朋友們，說自己要回鎖川避避風頭？要不是你一直在這裡，咳，土下座，現在連他們都要危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不是也說什麼用生命擔保萌萌香他們絕無異心，肯定是好人之類的。您這麼急公好義，我就只是去上一下廁所——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別恭維我了。等一下葉和錦織兩家的家主出來，你如果在這裡還好說，如果跑了……呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子餓了嗎？餓了我這裡有竹輪，先隨便吃點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，宮司大人，我聽神社的人說，您有個女兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，比你小一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會不會像剛剛兇我一樣兇她啊？"},{"type":"narration","text":"神職愣了一下，像是看什麼不可理喻、無法交流的生物一樣看了更紗一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？兇麗薩？你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟她不是也像我一樣偷偷溜走了嗎？我好歹還在東國境內，聽說她都跑去敘拉古了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的神職","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次如果你見到英格麗，讓她慢慢跟你解釋吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"門忽然開了。\n萬幸更紗提前意識到門縫裡傳來的光線有變，在千鈞一髮之際回歸了土下座的姿勢。\n而宮司也立刻會意，挺直脊背，低下頭顱，侍立一旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，請再次容許我代表錦織家向您，向葉家致歉。錦織家管教後輩無方，給葉家添了麻煩，萬分抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亞女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您言重了。大事都已談妥，我還要感謝令嬡給我們雙方一個當面交流的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亞女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"御機出了如此顢頇無能的議員，縱容暴力團逞凶，令嬡也是路見不平而已，何錯之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亞女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於您好奇的神明行蹤……恕我冒昧，暫且還是順其自然，最為妥當……"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩位家主緩緩走過神社的庭園，走向神域的出口，彷彿全然未曾注意到，自己身後還有一跪一站的兩個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更紗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣……算是平安過關了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的宮司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且算是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更紗，該回家了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒼老的阿戈爾男性站定在神社的入口處，若無其事地喚了一聲。\n更紗愣了一下，原本因逃過一劫而高興得通紅的臉頰一下子白了下去。\n她抬頭看了看神社這方被圈起來的天空，閉上雙眼，在自以為父親看不到的地方握緊了拳頭……\n隨後，換上一副乖巧而木然的表情，小步跟上父親，緩緩離去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
